### `333 serve --tor`: an onion address, for a node that is hiding.

serve-onion-launching = 正在启动 onion 服务

serve-onion-raising = 隐藏地址。这可能要几分钟。
    .keyword = 开启中

serve-onion-not-reachable = { $seconds } 秒后仍无法到达

serve-onion-waiting = 正在等待服务可到达

serve-onion-unseen = { $address }
    .keyword = 隐藏

serve-onion-invite = { $invitation }
    .keyword = 邀请

serve-onion-accepting = 正在接受对方

serve-onion-not-built = 本客户端编译时没有 Tor，无法发布 onion 地址
